## SQ-PTH-12c | a pickarang held in a lone web; web broken: it drops as an item
> setblock 1116 -59 1000 minecraft:cobweb
> clear P
> tp P 1116.5 -60 996.5 0 0
> zpth watchnew quark:pickarang k12c 300 10 1116.5 -59 999 5
> pbot hold P quark:pickarang 1
